	"VersionName": "0.1.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Mod Framework",
	"Description": "A game-agnostic modding framework for Unreal Engine. Provides mod discovery, JSON manifests, semantic versioning, dependency resolution and deterministic load ordering, a full mod lifecycle, content mounting, API and extension registries, a permission system, mod-isolated save data, multiplayer manifest validation and SDK generation.",
	"Category": "Modding",
	"CreatedBy": "Aydan Edwards",
